# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Service instances in the Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"
msgstr "Instâncias de serviço na Resource Controller API {#service-instances-in-the-resource-controller-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API is a separate API. You use it to create and update service instances. If you create or update instances with this API, change the instance parameters too.\n"
msgstr "A IBM Cloud&reg; Resource Controller API é uma API separada. Você a usa para criar e atualizar instâncias de serviço. Se você cria ou atualiza instâncias com essa API, altere também os parâmetros da instância.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you create or update an instance, send these parameters in the request:\n"
msgstr "Ao criar ou atualizar uma instância, envie estes parâmetros na requisição:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Don't send | Send instead | Type of the new parameter |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Number or `null` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Não envie | Envie no lugar | Tipo do novo parâmetro |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `instance_limit_seconds` | `instance_limit_ru` | Número ou `null` |\n"
"| `usage_allocation_seconds` | `usage_allocation_ru` | Número ou `null` |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The parameters have these meanings:\n"
msgstr "Os parâmetros têm estes significados:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Instance limit**The maximum usage for the instance. If you do not send a limit on the Open Plan, the default is the RU equivalent of 10 minutes.\n"
msgstr "**Limite da instância**O uso máximo da instância. Se você não enviar um limite no Open Plan, o padrão é o equivalente em RUs a 10 minutos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Usage allocation**: The share of usage for the instance. The fair-share scheduler uses this value to set the priority of the instance in the queue. The allocation does not apply to Pay-As-You-Go instances.\n"
msgstr "**Alocação de uso**: A parcela de uso da instância. O escalonador de compartilhamento justo usa esse valor para definir a prioridade da instância na fila. A alocação não se aplica a instâncias Pay-As-You-Go.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you read an instance, the `extensions` object in the response contains the old fields and the new fields. Disregard `instance_limit_seconds` and `usage_allocation_seconds`. Read `instance_limit_ru` and `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"
msgstr "Ao ler uma instância, o objeto `extensions` na resposta contém os campos antigos e os novos. Ignore `instance_limit_seconds` e `usage_allocation_seconds`. Leia `instance_limit_ru` e `usage_allocation_ru`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more information, see the [IBM Quantum Compute Service REST API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"
msgstr "Para mais informações, consulte a [documentação da REST API do IBM Quantum Compute Service](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-runtime-rest).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics {#usage-analytics}"
msgstr "Análise de uso {#usage-analytics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped`, and `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"
msgstr "Endpoints: `GET /v1/analytics/usage`, `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped` e `GET /v1/analytics/usage_grouped_by_date`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The three endpoints have the same usage fields. The two grouped endpoints return these fields for each group or each date.\n"
msgstr "Os três endpoints têm os mesmos campos de uso. Os dois endpoints agrupados retornam esses campos para cada grupo ou cada data.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The old analytics usage fields are in milliseconds, not seconds.\n"
msgstr "Os campos antigos de uso de analytics estão em milissegundos, não em segundos.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-24
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Disregard (milliseconds) | Read instead (RUs) |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage` | `usage_ru` |\n"
"| `sessions_usage` | `sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_sessions_usage` | `avg_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_sessions_usage` | `max_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `batch_sessions_usage` | `batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_batch_sessions_usage` | `avg_batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_batch_sessions_usage` | `max_batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `dedicated_sessions_usage` | `dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_dedicated_sessions_usage` | `avg_dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_dedicated_sessions_usage` | `max_dedicated_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `individual_jobs_usage` | `individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_individual_jobs_usage` | `avg_individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_individual_jobs_usage` | `max_individual_jobs_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `functions_quantum_usage_ms` | `functions_quantum_usage_ru` |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Ignore (milissegundos) | Leia no lugar (RUs) |\n"
"| --- | --- |\n"
"| `usage` | `usage_ru` |\n"
"| `sessions_usage` | `sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `avg_sessions_usage` | `avg_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `max_sessions_usage` | `max_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
"| `batch_sessions_usage` | `batch_sessions_usage_ru` |\n"
